  "verdict": [
    "The model earns its place, but on 4 of 7 typologies only: ACCOUNT_TAKEOVER, SOCIAL_ENGINEERING, SIM_SWAP, DORMANT_ACCOUNT. Everywhere else the rules alone match the full system inside the measurement error, so the architecture is justified by those 4 rather than by all 7."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Rule list membership (sanctioned, known mule, allowlist) is empty offline, so the two OVERRIDE rules and one SUPPRESS rule contribute nothing here. In production they would.",
    "141 to 544 incidents per typology. 95% intervals are up to about 0.17 wide, so arms whose intervals overlap are not distinguishable on this corpus."
  ]
}